#: 4.x/g101/index.html
msgid "<h1 id=i-classfas-fa-graduation-capinbspgodot-101><i class='fas fa-graduation-cap'></i> Godot 101</h1><p><a href=#image-581000926a10855ad119d152f960d507 class=lightbox-link><img src=\"/godot_recipes/4.x/img/godot3_logo.png?width=250\" alt=alt style=height:auto;width:250 loading=lazy> </a><a href=javascript:history.back(); class=lightbox id=image-581000926a10855ad119d152f960d507><img src=\"/godot_recipes/4.x/img/godot3_logo.png?width=250\" alt=alt class=lightbox-image loading=lazy></a></p><p>Your introduction to the Godot game engine. If you&rsquo;ve never used a game engine before, or if you’re just new to Godot, this is the place to start.</p><h4 id=in-this-section>In this section:</h4><ul class=\"children children-li children-sort-weight\"><li><a href=/godot_recipes/4.x/g101/start/index.html>Getting Started</a></li><li><a href=/godot_recipes/4.x/g101/gdscript/index.html>Introduction to GDScript</a></li><li><a href=/godot_recipes/4.x/g101/3d/index.html>Intro to 3D</a></li></ul><h4 id=see-also>See also:</h4><ul><li><a href=/godot_recipes/4.x/games/first_2d>Game Tutorials/Your First 2D Game</a></li></ul><footer class=footline></footer>"
msgstr ""

