msgid "<h1 id=audio-manager>Audio Manager</h1><h2 id=problem>Problem</h2><p>You&rsquo;ve tried adding an <i class=gd-AudioStreamPlayer></i> to your mob/coin/etc. to play when the object dies or is collected. But the problem is that when you remove the object, the audio player goes with it, chopping off the sound. You need an easier way to manage playing audio.</p><h2 id=solution>Solution</h2><p>We&rsquo;ll solve this problem with a node that is available from anywhere in the SceneTree. This node manages a set of <i class=gd-AudioStreamPlayer></i> nodes and a queue of sound streams to play.</p><p>Create a new script in the script editor:</p><div class=highlight></div><p>Set this script as an autoload in Project Settings. Give it an easily recognizable name, such as &ldquo;AudioManager&rdquo;.</p><p><a href=#image-fed01c651b93b96a296b6517a976d827 class=lightbox-link><img src=/godot_recipes/4.x/img/audio_mgr_01.png alt=alt style=height:auto;width:auto loading=lazy> </a><a href=javascript:history.back(); class=lightbox id=image-fed01c651b93b96a296b6517a976d827><img src=/godot_recipes/4.x/img/audio_mgr_01.png alt=alt class=lightbox-image loading=lazy></a></p><p>Anywhere in your project that you want to play a sound, use:</p><div class=highlight></div><p>Remember, you can drag sound files directly into the text editor to paste the file path.</p><div class=\"box notices cstyle note\"><div class=box-label><i class=\"fa-fw fas fa-exclamation-circle\"></i> Note</div><div class=box-content><p>This audio manager is adapted with thanks from [SFXPlayer by TheDuriel] (<a href=https://github.com/TheDuriel/DurielsGodotUtilities%29 target=_blank>https://github.com/TheDuriel/DurielsGodotUtilities)</a>.</p></div></div><h3 id=example-project>Example project</h3><p>Below you can download an example project showing the use of the audio manager node. This project reads a folder full of audio files and generates a grid of buttons. Click the button to play the sound.</p><p><a href=#image-b0c77f5167f0c9a16e59d30b7a84efe5 class=lightbox-link><img src=/godot_recipes/4.x/img/audio_mgr_02.png alt=alt style=height:auto;width:auto loading=lazy> </a><a href=javascript:history.back(); class=lightbox id=image-b0c77f5167f0c9a16e59d30b7a84efe5><img src=/godot_recipes/4.x/img/audio_mgr_02.png alt=alt class=lightbox-image loading=lazy></a></p><p>At the top, you can see the audio manager&rsquo;s live statistics.</p><h2 id=i-classfas-fa-code-branchi-download-this-project><i class=\"fas fa-code-branch\"></i> Download This Project</h2><p>Download the project&rsquo;s example code here: <a href=https://github.com/godotrecipes/audio_manager target=_blank>https://github.com/godotrecipes/audio_manager</a></p><footer class=footline></footer>"
msgstr ""

#: 4.x/audio/audio_manager/index.html
msgid "<ul><li id=select-language-container class=footerLangSwitch><div class=\"padding select-container\"><i class=\"fas fa-language fa-fw\"></i> <span>&nbsp;</span><div class=select-style><label class=a11y-only for=select-language>Language</label> <select id=select-language onchange=\"location=baseUri+this.value\"><option lang=en id=en value=/godot_recipes/4.x/audio/audio_manager/index.html selected></option></select>"
